{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in development;</strong> Engines of Destruction is a next generation mech simulator, playble in PvP, Co-op and singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/7990babfc8bf54723e46b25c257bb0a2.avif?t=1760717557\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot enormous mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit of giant fighting machines, customise them with a wide choice of weapons, equipment, paintjobs and more. Blow enemies away with per module damage systems and use your radar for weapon targeting, enemy unit detecting and identifying friend from foe. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.poster.avif?t=1760717557\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.webm?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/0f4d28c47fe53f31164f6226ec3bb2f8.mp4?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Playable on VR and Desktop </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EOD is fully playable in PCVR and on desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/2ddb79b5e173c80f427f036d44d0f78f.poster.avif?t=1760717557\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/2ddb79b5e173c80f427f036d44d0f78f.webm?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/2ddb79b5e173c80f427f036d44d0f78f.mp4?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamemodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in several different gamemodes, against other players or the onslaughting waves of AI enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/47c7c24a7f5f3b711d4349410988a2d6.poster.avif?t=1760717557\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/47c7c24a7f5f3b711d4349410988a2d6.webm?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/47c7c24a7f5f3b711d4349410988a2d6.mp4?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechs also feature a large amount of customisation, all weapon systems can be switched out. They can also be fitted with smoke grenade launchers, additional armour, bigger reactions, rocket thrusters and much much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/e5aecdec572d2d9dc48aa258f5ed9b04.poster.avif?t=1760717557\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/e5aecdec572d2d9dc48aa258f5ed9b04.webm?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/e5aecdec572d2d9dc48aa258f5ed9b04.mp4?t=1760717557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Gamemode in the Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a level editor allowing the creation of new user generated gamemodes and missions.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1937070?t=1760717557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/752dafc1caa431b1c103d2afb8400ff7a2697fb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760717557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/6784a091fd87c1f245916fc5d883fcedbb14cd21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760717557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/6784a091fd87c1f245916fc5d883fcedbb14cd21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760717557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence, No depicition of Blood/Gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in development;</strong> Engines of Destruction is a next generation mech simulator, playble in PvP, Co-op and singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/7990babfc8bf54723e46b25c257bb0a2.avif?t=1760717557\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot enormous mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit of giant fighting machines, customise them with a wide choice of weapons, equipment, paintjobs and more. Blow enemies away with per module damage systems and use your radar for weapon targeting, 